  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p><!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HY울릉도M; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M; mso-ascii-font-family: HY울릉도M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">7</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"font-family: HY울릉도M; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M;\">단원 </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HY울릉도M; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M; mso-ascii-font-family: HY울릉도M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&lt;</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"font-family: HY울릉도M; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M;\">수권과 해수의 순환</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HY울릉도M; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M; mso-ascii-font-family: HY울릉도M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&gt; </sp