체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">차시</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp; 소단원 안내 및 희망 주제에 따른 모둠 편성</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">차시</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp; 모둠별 해당 소단원 분석</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">요청 준비물을 포함한 계획서 제출</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(2</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">차시</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp; 모둠별 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">ppt </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">만들기 및 발표 자료 완성</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(3</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">차시</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 4</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">차시</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) : </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">컴퓨터실</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp; 발표하기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(2, 3 </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">모둠</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">/ 4, 5 </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">모둠</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) (5</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">차시</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 6</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">차시</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp; 발표하기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(1 </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">모둠</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교사의 보충 설명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(7</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">차시</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">기타</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp; 1 </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">모둠은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월 초에 국외 체험학습에 선발되어 떠나는 팀으로만 구성하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이들은 컴퓨터를 사용하지 않고 처음부터 끝까지 수작업으로 발표 자료를 완성하고 제출한 다음</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">귀국하여 바로 발표하기로 약속하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">다른 모둠의 주제에 비해 상대적으로 내용이 쉬워서</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">모둠별 상호 평가할 때 낮은 점수가 나올까 염려되어 내린 결정입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp; 다른 모둠의 경우</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">권장 형식은 알려주되</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그대로 할지 다른 방법으로 바꿀지는 모둠 회의를 통해 결정하라고 안내하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. ppt </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">제작 역시 의무는 아니고, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">다른 자료를 만들어 활용해도 된다고 알렸습니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp; 발표 시간은 모둠별로 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">20</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">실제 발표는 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분을 넘어가지 않겠지만 질문을 주고받으며 자신들의 눈높이에서 교과서의 내용을 빠짐없이 분석해보라는 의도입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp; 준비하는 과정을 보니 용어 찾기에 가장 많은 시간을 할애하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">하천</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">빙하</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">염류</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">염분</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">고위도</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">저위도</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">…</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">심지어 홍해가 무엇인지 모르는 아이들도 많아 지구본을 가져가도록 하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp; 오늘까지 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">차시가 진행되었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">준비 과정을 보니 기대됩니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">느낌도 좋습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. ^^ </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">발표 자료가 나오면 다시 올리겠습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.<br></span></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
